OL,3,GNEWSARepairing York potholes a
OL,4,A'juggling act' - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaintaining York's historic roads is a
OL,7,Fcomplex "juggling act" due to its
OL,8,Funique network, a senior city
OL,9,Fcouncillor has claimed.
OL,11,FA fifth of York's residential roads are
OL,12,Fcurrently in need of repair - down from
OL,13,Fa third a year ago - according to the
OL,14,Fcity council's executive member for
OL,15,Ftransport Kate Ravilious.
OL,17,FPlanned highway maintenance has been
OL,18,Fpaused until 2027 to reduce disruption
OL,19,Fduring the busy York Christmas Market
OL,20,Fperiod.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
