OL,3,GNEWSARepairing York potholes a
OL,4,A'juggling act' - council
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Just because of the number of
OL,7,Fvisitors, the number of businesses and
OL,8,Fthe number of deliveries coming in and
OL,9,Fout, there's so much going on that it
OL,10,Fdoes make it a really challenging place
OL,11,Fto do those works," Ravilious said.
